    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.map\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nI can't seem to make the minimap plugin respect my colorscheme (catppuccin) and have the transparency enabled. It just a solid color for the background.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beced8c5-a1b8-432f-9bf3-97ff60b31e3a)\n\n### Reproduction\n\nTurn on integration for mini in Catppuccin and toggle minimap.",
