            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm not completely sure, but I think Catppuccin was already integrated [here](https://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/fa42eb5e26819ef58884257d5ae95dd0552b9a66/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/mini.lua#L79).\n\nTo change the minimap color, you can check [highlight MiniMap](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/48f48e4b3f317e9da34ee7a01958b4c5018e2d34/doc/mini-map.txt#L128-L135), where it explains `:help highlight`. You can change the highlight colors there, for example:\n`:hi! MiniMapNormal guibg=None`",
