            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is a known Neovim issue with floating windows when its 'winblend' is not 0.\n\nTo have a completely transparent mini-map window, set [`config.window.winblend`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/48f48e4b3f317e9da34ee7a01958b4c5018e2d34/doc/mini-map.txt#L226-L227) to 100.",
            "created_at": "2025-07-04T09:45:15Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1885#issuecomment-3035246207",
            "id": 3035246207,
