            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> On my side, I had to set the winblend option for mini.map to 0 and neovim's option to 0 and it worked.\n\nYeah, that looks like the effect of neovim/neovim#18576 which should be fixed on latest `master`. I.e. it should work in the next 0.12 Neovim release.",
